---
---

<section id="canais" class="multichannel-section">
  <div class="shell">
    <div class="section-header">
      <span class="section-tag">MULTICANALIDADE INTEGRADA</span>
      <h2 class="section-title">
        Todos os seus canais de atendimento <br />
        <span class="highlight">em um só lugar.</span>
      </h2>
      <p class="section-desc">
        Seja pelo WhatsApp, Direct do Instagram, TikTok ou chat do site, seus clientes são atendidos com a mesma inteligência e agilidade.
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- Channels Showcase Grid -->
    <div class="channels-grid">
      <div class="channel-card">
        <div class="channel-icon-wrap wa-bg">
          <span>💬</span>
        </div>
        <h3>WhatsApp</h3>
        <p>Conecte múltiplos números da empresa e dos colaboradores na mesma central.</p>
        <span class="ch-badge">Canal Principal</span>
      </div>

      <div class="channel-card">
        <div class="channel-icon-wrap ig-bg">
          <span>📸</span>
        </div>
        <h3>Instagram Direct</h3>
        <p>Responda dúvidas sobre posts, reels e stories direto no painel com IA ou equipe.</p>
        <span class="ch-badge">Instagram</span>
      </div>

      <div class="channel-card">
        <div class="channel-icon-wrap tt-bg">
          <span>🎵</span>
        </div>
        <h3>TikTok</h3>
        <p>Atenda mensagens recebidas da sua conta comercial do TikTok sem trocar de tela.</p>
        <span class="ch-badge">TikTok</span>
      </div>

      <div class="channel-card">
        <div class="channel-icon-wrap web-bg">
          <span>🌐</span>
        </div>
        <h3>Chat do Site</h3>
        <p>Widget interativo instalado no seu site que captura o lead e envia para o WhatsApp.</p>
        <span class="ch-badge">Website</span>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Humanized Interactions Banner -->
    <div class="humanized-features-box">
      <div class="hf-title">✨ Atendimento Humanizado que Aproxima</div>
      <div class="hf-grid">
        <div class="hf-item">
          <span class="hf-emoji">❤️</span>
          <div>
            <strong>Reage a Mensagens</strong>
            <p>Reage com emojis amigáveis no momento certo para criar conexão.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="hf-item">
          <span class="hf-emoji">🎧</span>
          <div>
            <strong>Escuta e Transcreve Áudios</strong>
            <p>Ouve áudios enviados pelos clientes e responde de forma rápida em texto.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="hf-item">
          <span class="hf-emoji">💬</span>
          <div>
            <strong>Tom Natural e Fluído</strong>
            <p>Escreve em frases curtas e humanas, exatamente como uma pessoa real.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .multichannel-section {
    padding: 90px 0;
    background: #0f172a;
    color: #fff;
    border-top: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08);
  }

  .shell {
    width: 100%;
    max-width: 1140px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 0 24px;
    box-sizing: border-box;
  }

  .section-header {
    text-align: center;
    max-width: 720px;
    margin: 0 auto 48px;
  }

  .section-tag {
    display: inline-block;
    padding: 4px 12px;
    border-radius: 20px;
    background: rgba(0, 168, 132, 0.15);
    color: #00a884;
    font-size: 11px;
    font-weight: 800;
    letter-spacing: 0.1em;
    margin-bottom: 16px;
  }

  .section-title {
    font-size: clamp(2rem, 3.5vw, 2.8rem);
    font-weight: 700;
    line-height: 1.15;
    letter-spacing: -0.03em;
  }

  .section-title .highlight {
    color: #4cd9a4;
  }

  .section-desc {
    margin-top: 16px;
    font-size: 1.05rem;
    line-height: 1.6;
    color: #94a3b8;
  }

  .channels-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr);
    gap: 16px;
    margin-bottom: 36px;
  }

  .channel-card {
    background: #1e293b;
    border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08);
    border-radius: 16px;
    padding: 20px;
    text-align: center;
    transition: transform 0.2s, border-color 0.2s;
  }

  .channel-card:hover {
    transform: translateY(-4px);
    border-color: rgba(0, 168, 132, 0.4);
  }

  .channel-icon-wrap {
    width: 44px;
    height: 44px;
    border-radius: 12px;
    display: grid;
    place-items: center;
    font-size: 20px;
    margin: 0 auto 14px;
  }

  .wa-bg { background: rgba(0, 168, 132, 0.2); }
  .ig-bg { background: rgba(225, 48, 108, 0.2); }
  .tt-bg { background: rgba(255, 0, 80, 0.2); }
  .web-bg { background: rgba(59, 130, 246, 0.2); }

  .channel-card h3 {
    font-size: 1.1rem;
    color: #f8fafc;
    margin-bottom: 8px;
  }

  .channel-card p {
    font-size: 12px;
    line-height: 1.5;
    color: #94a3b8;
    margin-bottom: 14px;
  }

  .ch-badge {
    font-size: 9px;
    font-weight: 800;
    color: #00a884;
    background: rgba(0, 168, 132, 0.1);
    padding: 3px 8px;
    border-radius: 6px;
  }

  /* Humanized Features */
  .humanized-features-box {
    background: #1e293b;
    border: 1px solid rgba(118, 89, 239, 0.35);
    border-radius: 18px;
    padding: 24px;
  }

  .hf-title {
    font-size: 14px;
    font-weight: 800;
    color: #a89cf0;
    text-align: center;
    margin-bottom: 20px;
    letter-spacing: 0.05em;
  }

  .hf-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
    gap: 20px;
  }

  .hf-item {
    display: flex;
    align-items: flex-start;
    gap: 12px;
    background: #0f172a;
    border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.06);
    border-radius: 12px;
    padding: 14px;
  }

  .hf-emoji { font-size: 22px; flex-shrink: 0; }

  .hf-item strong {
    display: block;
    font-size: 13px;
    color: #f8fafc;
    margin-bottom: 4px;
  }

  .hf-item p {
    font-size: 11.5px;
    color: #94a3b8;
    margin: 0;
  }

  @media (max-width: 900px) {
    .channels-grid, .hf-grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }
  }
</style>
